@server = http://localhost:4004
@credentials = Authorization: Basic P029977:
@contentType = Content-Type: application/json

# Notes:
# - Real IAS authorization must be tested through approuter/browser session.
# - For local BAS, use only existing dev auth headers/mechanisms already configured in this project.

@processId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@masterObjectId = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
@requestId = 33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333
@fieldId = 44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444
@requestValueId = 55555555-5555-5555-5555-555555555555

### 1) Create request (backend defaults STATUS=DRAFT if missing)
POST {{server}}/mdg/Requests
{{credentials}}
{{contentType}}

{
  "ID": "{{requestId}}",
  "PROCESS_ID": "{{processId}}",
  "MASTER_OBJECT_ID": "{{masterObjectId}}",
  "COUNTRY_CODE": "CL",
  "SUBJECT_TYPE": "CUSTOMER",
  "SUBJECT_ID": "0000123456",
  "SUBJECT_NAME": "Cliente Demo"
}

### 2) Create request value (role/status + field-control enforced)
POST {{server}}/mdg/RequestValues
{{credentials}}
{{contentType}}

{
  "ID": "{{requestValueId}}",
  "REQUEST_ID": "{{requestId}}",
  "FIELD_ID": "{{fieldId}}",
  "LINE_NO": 1,
  "VALUE": "Santiago"
}

### 3) Submit via PATCH STATUS=SUBMITTED (backend auto-converts to IN_REVIEW)
PATCH {{server}}/mdg/Requests(ID={{requestId}})
{{credentials}}
{{contentType}}

{
  "STATUS": "SUBMITTED"
}

### 4) Post request comment (chat)
POST {{server}}/mdg/RequestComments
{{credentials}}
{{contentType}}

{
  "REQUEST_ID": "{{requestId}}",
  "MESSAGE": "Se adjunta comentario desde turno 6"
}

### 5) Approve request (MANAGER only; ROLE_CODE=APPROVER in DB)
POST {{server}}/mdg/approveRequest
{{credentials}}
{{contentType}}

{
  "ID": "{{requestId}}",
  "COMMENT": "Aprobado por manager"
}

### 6) Reject request (MANAGER only; returns REWORK)
POST {{server}}/mdg/rejectRequest
{{credentials}}
{{contentType}}

{
  "ID": "{{requestId}}",
  "COMMENT": "Rechazado: faltan antecedentes"
}
